@startuml
title Serviqo - Module 8: Admin Dashboard & Monitoring

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Administrator as Admin
actor Customer
actor Worker

rectangle "Serviqo Admin Dashboard & Monitoring (Web)" {
  usecase "View platform analytics" as ViewAnalytics
  usecase "View user, job,\nverification and dispute totals" as ViewMetrics

  usecase "Manage user accounts" as ManageUsers
  usecase "Search, filter and\npaginate users" as FindUsers
  usecase "Activate or suspend\nan account" as ChangeUserStatus

  usecase "Review worker verification" as ReviewVerification
  usecase "View submitted identity\ndocuments" as ViewDocuments
  usecase "Approve worker verification" as ApproveWorker
  usecase "Reject with a required\nreview note" as RejectWorker

  usecase "Monitor marketplace jobs" as MonitorJobs
  usecase "View and filter jobs\nby status or category" as ViewJobs

  usecase "Manage disputes" as ManageDisputes
  usecase "Review disputes" as ReviewDisputes
  usecase "Record dispute resolution" as ResolveDispute

  usecase "Submit a job-related dispute" as RaiseDispute
  usecase "View own submitted or\nreceived disputes" as ViewOwnDisputes
}

Admin -- ViewAnalytics
Admin -- ManageUsers
Admin -- ReviewVerification
Admin -- MonitorJobs
Admin -- ManageDisputes

Customer -- RaiseDispute
Worker -- RaiseDispute
Customer -- ViewOwnDisputes
Worker -- ViewOwnDisputes

ViewAnalytics ..> ViewMetrics : <<include>>
ManageUsers ..> FindUsers : <<include>>
ChangeUserStatus ..> ManageUsers : <<extend>>

ReviewVerification ..> ViewDocuments : <<include>>
ApproveWorker ..> ReviewVerification : <<extend>>
RejectWorker ..> ReviewVerification : <<extend>>

MonitorJobs ..> ViewJobs : <<include>>

ManageDisputes ..> ReviewDisputes : <<include>>
ResolveDispute ..> ReviewDisputes : <<extend>>

note right of ManageUsers
The admin can search, filter and
paginate user records, then activate
or suspend an account. The implemented
admin API does not change user roles.
end note

note right of ReviewVerification
Admins review worker-submitted documents.
Rejection requires a note explaining
what the worker should correct.
end note

note bottom of MonitorJobs
Admin job monitoring is read-only and
supports status/category filters.
end note

note bottom of ManageDisputes
Admins can view and update dispute
resolution/status. Customers and workers
can submit disputes and view disputes
in which they are involved.
end note

note bottom of ViewAnalytics
Admin dashboard functionality is
available through the web portal.
end note

@enduml
